Subject: [PATCH 3/6] usb: xhci-mtk: fix ISOC error when interval is zero
Date:   Wed, 29 Aug 2018 10:55:15 +0800
Message-ID: <0c4244695d4dd8bf9cb1d2d0291783974c56ff7a.1535510898.git.chunfeng.yun@mediatek.com>
